#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:88
msgid ""
"The LLM provider to use for AI features. Select \"None (Disabled)\" to "
"disable AI features. Note: AI features must also be enabled in the server"
" configuration (LLM_ENABLED) for this setting to take effect."
msgstr "用于 AI 功能的 LLM 提供方。选择“无（禁用）”可禁用 AI 功能。注意：此设置要生效，还必须在服务器配置（LLM_ENABLED）中启用 AI 功能。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:102
msgid "Max Tool Iterations"
msgstr "最大工具迭代次数"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:108
msgid ""
"Maximum number of tool call iterations allowed during an AI conversation."
" Higher values allow more complex queries but may consume more resources."
" Default is 20."
msgstr "AI 对话期间允许的最大工具调用迭代次数。值越大，允许执行越复杂的查询，但可能会消耗更多资源。默认值为 20。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:124 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:185
#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:248 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:291
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "API URL"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:128
msgid ""
"URL for the Anthropic API endpoint. Leave empty to use the default "
"(https://api.anthropic.com/v1). Set a custom URL to use an Anthropic-"
"compatible API provider."
msgstr "Anthropic API 端点的 URL。留空以使用默认值（https://api.anthropic.com/v1）。设置自定义 URL 以使用兼容 Anthropic 的 API 提供方。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:136 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:200
msgid "API Key File"
msgstr "API 密钥文件"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:140
msgid ""
"Path to a file containing your Anthropic API key. This path must be on "
"the server hosting pgAdmin, e.g. inside the container when using Docker. "
"The file should contain only the API key. The API key may be optional "
"when using a custom API URL with a provider that does not require "
"authentication."
msgstr "包含您的 Anthropic API 密钥的文件的路径。此路径必须位于托管 pgAdmin 的服务器上，例如使用 Docker 时位于容器内。文件应仅包含 API 密钥。当使用不需要认证的提供方的自定义 API URL 时，API 密钥可能是可选的。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:154 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:218
#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:262 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:308
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:159
msgid ""
"The Anthropic model to use. Models are loaded dynamically from your API "
"key. You can also type a custom model name. Leave empty to use the "
"default (Claude Sonnet 4)."
msgstr "要使用的 Anthropic 模型。模型会根据您的 API 密钥动态加载。您也可以输入自定义模型名称。留空以使用默认值（Claude Sonnet 4）。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:167 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:231
#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:275 pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:321
msgid "Select or type a model name..."
msgstr "选择或输入模型名称..."

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:189
msgid ""
"URL for the OpenAI API endpoint. Leave empty to use the default "
"(https://api.openai.com/v1). Set a custom URL to use any OpenAI-"
"compatible API provider such as LiteLLM, LM Studio, or EXO. The URL "
"should include the /v1 path prefix if required by your provider (e.g., "
"http://localhost:1234/v1)."
msgstr "OpenAI API 端点的 URL。留空以使用默认值（https://api.openai.com/v1）。设置自定义 URL 以使用任何兼容 OpenAI 的 API 提供方，例如 LiteLLM、LM Studio 或 EXO。如果您的提供方要求，URL 应包含 /v1 路径前缀（例如 http://localhost:1234/v1）。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:204
msgid ""
"Path to a file containing your OpenAI API key. This path must be on the "
"server hosting pgAdmin, e.g. inside the container when using Docker. The "
"file should contain only the API key. The API key may be optional when "
"using a custom API URL with a provider that does not require "
"authentication."
msgstr "包含您的 OpenAI API 密钥的文件的路径。此路径必须位于托管 pgAdmin 的服务器上，例如使用 Docker 时位于容器内。文件应仅包含 API 密钥。当使用不需要认证的提供方的自定义 API URL 时，API 密钥可能是可选的。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:223
msgid ""
"The OpenAI model to use. Models are loaded dynamically from your API key."
" You can also type a custom model name. Leave empty to use the default "
"(GPT-4o)."
msgstr "要使用的 OpenAI 模型。模型会根据您的 API 密钥动态加载。您也可以输入自定义模型名称。留空以使用默认值（GPT-4o）。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:252
msgid "URL for the Ollama API endpoint (e.g., http://localhost:11434)."
msgstr "Ollama API 端点的 URL（例如 http://localhost:11434）。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:267
msgid ""
"The Ollama model to use. Models are loaded dynamically from your Ollama "
"server. You can also type a custom model name. Leave empty to use the "
"default (llama3.2)."
msgstr "要使用的 Ollama 模型。模型会根据您的 Ollama 服务器动态加载。您也可以输入自定义模型名称。留空以使用默认值（llama3.2）。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:295
msgid ""
"URL for the Docker Model Runner API endpoint (e.g., "
"http://localhost:12434). Available in Docker Desktop 4.40 and later. Tip:"
" You can also use the OpenAI provider with a custom API URL for any "
"OpenAI-compatible endpoint, including Docker Model Runner."
msgstr "Docker Model Runner API 端点的 URL（例如 http://localhost:12434）。在 Docker Desktop 4.40 及更高版本中可用。提示：您也可以使用带有自定义 API URL 的 OpenAI 提供方连接任何兼容 OpenAI 的端点，包括 Docker Model Runner。"

#: pgadmin/llm/__init__.py:313
msgid ""
"The Docker model to use. Models are loaded dynamically from your Docker "
"Model Runner. You can also type a custom model name. Leave empty to use "
"the default (ai/qwen3-coder)."
msgstr "要使用的 Docker 模型。模型会根据您的 Docker Model Runner 动态加载。您也可以输入自定义模型名称。留空以使用默认值（ai/qwen3-coder）。"

