msgstr "设置新查询工具标签页中默认的自动回滚开或关。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:137
msgid ""
"If set to True, the dataset will be fetched using a server-side cursor "
"after the query is executed. This allows controlled data transfer to the "
"client, enabling examination of large datasets without loading them "
"entirely into memory."
msgstr "如果设置为 True，查询执行后将使用服务器端游标获取数据集。这允许将数据受控地传输到客户端，从而无需将大型数据集完全加载到内存中即可进行检查。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:146
msgid "Prompt to save unsaved query changes?"
msgstr "提示保存未保存的查询更改？"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:149
msgid ""
"Specifies whether or not to prompt the user to save unsaved queries on "
"Query Tool exit."
msgstr "指定退出查询工具时是否提示用户保存未保存的查询。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:156
msgid "Sort View Data results by primary key columns?"
msgstr "按主键列对查看数据结果排序？"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:159
msgid ""
"If set to True, data returned when using the View/Edit Data - All Rows "
"option will be sorted by the Primary Key columns by default. When using "
"the First/Last 100 Rows options, data is always sorted."
msgstr "如果设置为 True，使用“查看/编辑数据 - 所有行”选项返回的数据将默认按主键列排序。使用“前/后 100 行”选项时，数据始终会排序。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:167
msgid "Default row limit for View Data"
msgstr "查看数据的默认行数限制"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:171
msgid ""
"Specify the maximum number of rows to fetch when using the View/Edit Data"
" - All Rows option. This appends a LIMIT clause to the generated query, "
"which can significantly improve performance on very large tables. Set to "
"0 (the default) to fetch all rows with no limit (the existing behavior). "
"This does not affect the First/Last 100 Rows options."
msgstr "指定使用“查看/编辑数据 - 所有行”选项时要获取的最大行数。这会向生成的查询追加一个 LIMIT 子句，可以显著提高超大型表的性能。设置为 0（默认值）以无限制地获取所有行（现有行为）。这不影响“前/后 100 行”选项。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:182
msgid "Prompt to save unsaved data changes?"
msgstr "提示保存未保存的数据更改？"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:185
msgid ""
"Specifies whether or not to prompt the user to save unsaved data on data "
"grid exit."
msgstr "指定退出数据网格时是否提示用户保存未保存的数据。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:192
msgid "Prompt to commit/rollback active transactions?"
msgstr "提示提交/回滚活动事务？"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:196
msgid ""
"Specifies whether or not to prompt the user to commit or rollback an "
"active transaction on Query Tool exit."
msgstr "指定退出查询工具时是否提示用户提交或回滚活动事务。"

