"plotted with very high numbers of rows."
msgstr "此设置指定图表上绘制的最大行数。如果使用非常高的行数绘制图表，增加此限制可能会影响性能。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:886
msgid "Custom tile provider URL"
msgstr "自定义瓦片提供商 URL"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:893
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"URL template of a custom XYZ tile provider used as a base layer in the "
"Geometry Viewer, e.g. https://myserver.example.com/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}.png."
" The template must contain the {x}, {y} and {z} placeholders, and may "
"contain {s} for subdomains (a, b, c). Leave empty to disable the custom "
"tile provider. Defaults to the administrator-configured "
"DEFAULT_GEOMETRY_VIEWER_PROVIDER, if any."
msgstr "用作“几何图形查看器”中基础图层的自定义 XYZ 瓦片提供商的 URL 模板，例如 https://myserver.example.com/tiles/{z}/{x}/{y}.png。模板必须包含 {x}、{y} 和 {z} 占位符，并且可以包含用于子域（a、b、c）的 {s}。留空以禁用自定义瓦片提供商。默认为管理员配置的 DEFAULT_GEOMETRY_VIEWER_PROVIDER（如果有）。"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:907
msgid "Custom tile provider name"
msgstr "自定义瓦片提供商名称"

#: pgadmin/tools/sqleditor/utils/query_tool_preferences.py:910
